:1,"section_title":"The theorem and the structure of the proof","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:c6ddd89766c4020b0bd2d46af0aaa0f04a4a184ba293c5b26fd39f40265f3f85","file":"preprints/A-spectral-gap-throughout-the-high-temperature-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-phase-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":33,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"c96f2e1f50d30cf9472ffe8327f6c19d3c70ca0d1826bdecb9bbff65cebd74f0","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/A-spectral-gap-throughout-the-high-temperature-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-phase-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:c6ddd89766c4020b0bd2d46af0aaa0f04a4a184ba293c5b26fd39f40265f3f85","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-spectral-gap-throughout-the-high-temperature-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-phase-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L33"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nThere is a finite constant $C_\\beta$, depending only on $\\beta$, such that\n\\[\n \\Prob_J\\left\\{\\Var_{\\mu_0}(f)\\le C_\\beta\\D_0(f)\n       \\text{ for every }f:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\longrightarrow\\R\\right\\}\n \\longrightarrow1.\n\\]\nConsequently, the discrete-time heat-bath chain that chooses a uniform site\nhas spectral gap at least $1/(C_\\beta n)$ with probability tending to one."}
